WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.180 --> 00:00:08.050
Let's go next to our caller from the eight
three to area code, who's calling today from

00:00:08.050 --> 00:00:10.740
83 to.

00:00:10.740 --> 00:00:12.660
Hi, my name's Drew.

00:00:12.660 --> 00:00:13.660
Can you hear me?

00:00:13.660 --> 00:00:14.660
Yeah.

00:00:14.660 --> 00:00:16.180
Drew, what's going on?

00:00:16.180 --> 00:00:24.130
That's basically my question is more regarding
the potential victory that we may or as Democrats,

00:00:24.130 --> 00:00:25.580
we might actually have.

00:00:25.580 --> 00:00:31.020
Do you think that if we end up winning in
2020, like collectively I'm talking the Senate,

00:00:31.020 --> 00:00:33.000
the House and the presidency.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:40.270
Do you think we can pull the same stuff that
Dick Cheney pulled in 2010 and basically redistrict

00:00:40.270 --> 00:00:48.110
so that we have more control over the legislature
and basically reverse redistricting, if you

00:00:48.110 --> 00:00:49.110
will?

00:00:49.110 --> 00:00:50.110
Okay.

00:00:50.110 --> 00:00:51.110
Yeah.

00:00:51.110 --> 00:00:52.110
So very important.

00:00:52.110 --> 00:00:54.520
So you're you're pointing out not only do
Democrats have the opportunity to take the

00:00:54.520 --> 00:00:58.350
White House, take the Senate and maintain
or extend control in the House, we also are

00:00:58.350 --> 00:01:00.860
in a census year, the 2020 census.

00:01:00.860 --> 00:01:08.450
And in 2021, that census will be used for
a whole bunch of different things, including

00:01:08.450 --> 00:01:10.280
redistricting, figuring out distribution of
funds.

00:01:10.280 --> 00:01:11.420
The answer is yes.

00:01:11.420 --> 00:01:18.000
And, you know, this is the there's a there
is a discussion that sometimes happens about

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:23.000
should the left just go low in order to keep
up with the right?

00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:29.030
And very often, I believe the answer is no
in the sense that if we need to do the immoral

00:01:29.030 --> 00:01:32.580
things they do to win, we're not really better.

00:01:32.580 --> 00:01:37.770
We're just saying, hey, we're all willing
to do the same stuff because we think we're

00:01:37.770 --> 00:01:38.770
right.

00:01:38.770 --> 00:01:39.910
That makes us just as bad as them.

00:01:39.910 --> 00:01:45.700
And so with a lot of these things, I'm not
for that when it comes to the census.

00:01:45.700 --> 00:01:53.250
If Democrats have the opportunity in 2021
to do all of the things that Republicans did

00:01:53.250 --> 00:01:59.320
after the 2010 census, then there's actually
a moral imperative to do it, because this

00:01:59.320 --> 00:02:02.340
is not about changing the system right now.

00:02:02.340 --> 00:02:03.610
This is how it works.

00:02:03.610 --> 00:02:07.159
And the opportunity comes every 10 years and
very often.

00:02:07.159 --> 00:02:09.950
Democrats have not been in power.

00:02:09.950 --> 00:02:13.540
And I believe that when it comes to redistricting
and distribution of funds on the basis of

00:02:13.540 --> 00:02:14.540
the census.

00:02:14.540 --> 00:02:18.829
Yes, if we especially if we hold the White
House, if we take the White House, hold the

00:02:18.829 --> 00:02:21.260
House and take the Senate, it is the opportunity.

00:02:21.260 --> 00:02:28.489
It must be done and we've got to do it and
not look back.

00:02:28.489 --> 00:02:29.489
I see that.

00:02:29.489 --> 00:02:30.489
I like you taking the high ground.

00:02:30.489 --> 00:02:31.489
But I've got to be honest.

00:02:31.489 --> 00:02:35.260
I'm tired of taking the high ground when it
comes to Republicans.

00:02:35.260 --> 00:02:40.530
I appreciate you being a little bit more a
decent person than I am.

00:02:40.530 --> 00:02:41.530
OK.

00:02:41.530 --> 00:02:42.530
I don't know that it's that.

00:02:42.530 --> 00:02:43.530
I mean, I think forever.

00:02:43.530 --> 00:02:47.459
It's interesting that you say say it that
way, because I think just everybody has a

00:02:47.459 --> 00:02:49.919
different bar.

00:02:49.919 --> 00:02:55.760
You know, some people would steal to feed
their family and some people would kill one

00:02:55.760 --> 00:02:59.340
person and some people might commit genocide
to feed their family.

00:02:59.340 --> 00:03:04.370
And it's not about good versus bad necessarily
in such moralistic terms.

00:03:04.370 --> 00:03:11.900
But I you know, I just I do think that it's
it's sometimes a difference of circumstance

00:03:11.900 --> 00:03:13.700
as well.

00:03:13.700 --> 00:03:16.540
And there's no there's no necessarily right
or wrong answer.

00:03:16.540 --> 00:03:19.889
But I appreciate the topic being brought up
and it is an important one.

00:03:19.889 --> 00:03:22.239
Thank you very much.

00:03:22.239 --> 00:03:23.239
OK.

00:03:23.239 --> 00:03:24.239
Thank you.

00:03:24.239 --> 00:03:24.450
Appreciate the phone call.

